            },
            "hints": [
              {
                "content": "Think about the different roles organisms play in an ecosystem. Which organisms are responsible for capturing energy directly from the sun, and which ones get their energy by eating others?",
                "images": {},
                "replace": false,
                "widgets": {}
              },
              {
                "content": "Remember that plants are producers; they make their own food using sunlight through photosynthesis. Animals are consumers; they get energy by eating other organisms. Both then use cellular respiration to release energy from food.",
                "images": {},
